<title>PHILIPPINES: Megaworld to offer preferred shares.</title>
<headline>Megaworld to offer preferred shares.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Megaworld Properties &amp; Holdings Inc said on Wednesday it is planning to raise 3.5 billion pesos from a preferred share offering to fund its various activities.</p>
</text>
